# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
part6 = {
    "“7分41秒，82摄氏度……嗯，我正在研究最适合指挥官的咖啡配比哦。”": "\"7 minutes and 41 seconds, 82 degrees Celsius... Mm, I'm researching the perfect coffee recipe for the Commander.\"",
    "“Darling~Darling！我会为你加油的！”\n大体积，细节更丰富……某人对它的记忆真的很深刻呢。": "\"Darling~ Darling! I'll cheer you on!\"\nLarger size with richer details... someone must have had a truly vivid memory of it.",
    "“Darling一定会给我更多奖励的~对吧！”": "\"Darling will definitely give me more rewards~ right?\"",
    "“Darling，我来啦！一直一直注视着我吧！”": "\"Darling, here I come! Keep your eyes on me forever and ever!\"",
    "“……希望我可以帮上您的忙。”": "\"...I hope I can be of help to you.\"",
    "“《假面神骑》展览会，情侣同行，一人免单……”指挥官，这个活动可以陪我去吗？免单不是重点啦，只是……想在这一天……和指挥官像情侣一样相处……": "\"Masked Paladin Exhibition: Couples attend together, one person goes free...\" Commander, would you go to this event with me? The free admission isn't the point, it's just... I want to spend this day... together with the Commander like a couple...",
    "“不要小看玩具设计师的力量哦！”": "\"Never underestimate the power of a toy designer!\"",
    "“为了指挥官”，你觉得这样说就可以了吗？对那个人，你又知道些什么？": "\"For the Commander\"—do you think saying that makes everything fine? What do you even know about that person?",
    "“主人，您不必担心前方的路。夜色再深，我的目光也会一直亮在您身后。您只需往前走，无需回头。”\n代理人轻轻拢了拢衣袖，帽檐压低的阴影恰好遮住半张脸，她将目光投向远方。": "\"Master, you have no need to worry about the path ahead. No matter how deep the night, my gaze will always shine behind you. You need only walk forward without looking back.\"\nAgent gently adjusts her sleeves, the shadow from her lowered brim concealing half her face as she turns her gaze toward the distance.",
    "“主人，房间我已为您打扫干净，您还有其他的事情需要吩咐吗？”获取后，可在中央卧室内布置该家具。": "\"Master, I have cleaned the room for you. Are there any other orders you have for me?\" After obtaining, this furniture can be placed in the Central Bedroom.",
    "“主脑”是无法被替代的。": "The Mastermind is irreplaceable.",
    "“今夜月明人尽望，不知秋思落谁家”……我所思念的长官近在咫尺，但仍有许多思念着您的人，如今还没能回到艾莫号上。不过我相信……总有一天，我们会再度重逢的。": "\"Tonight all gaze upon the full, bright moon; upon whose home does autumn yearning fall?\"... The Commander I yearn for is right before my eyes, yet there are still many who yearn for you who have not yet returned to the Elmo. But I believe... one day, we will all reunite once more.",
    "“你……你要坐上来吗？我得有点准备才行……”获取后，可在中央卧室内布置该家具。": "\"Y-You want to sit on me? I need to get ready first...\" After obtaining, this furniture can be placed in the Central Bedroom.",
    "“呵呵，请不要客气，尽情吩咐我吧~”": "\"Hehe, please don't be shy. Feel free to command me as you wish~\"",
    "“呼，做好准备……我、我一定没问题的……”\n大体积，细节更丰富……某人对它的记忆真的很深刻呢。": "\"Phew, get ready... I-I'll definitely be fine...\"\nLarger size with richer details... someone must have had a truly vivid memory of it.",
    "“哎呀~坐在我身上你会很害羞吗？”获取后，可在中央卧室内布置该家具。": "\"Oh my~ does sitting on me make you feel shy?\" After obtaining, this furniture can be placed in the Central Bedroom.",
    "“唔……要怎么办呢……”": "\"Ngh... what should I do...\"",
    "“唔，指挥官，请不要这样看着我……”\n大体积，细节更丰富……某人对它的记忆真的很深刻呢。": "\"Uhm, Commander, please don't look at me like that...\"\nLarger size with richer details... someone must have had a truly vivid memory of it.",
    "“嗅嗅——嗅嗅——你们玩的时候一定要带上我！”获取后，可在中央卧室内布置该家具。": "\"Sniff, sniff—you have to include me whenever you're playing!\" After obtaining, this furniture can be placed in the Central Bedroom.",
    "“嘿嘿，指挥官要不要趁着休息的时候，陪我玩玩游戏呢？”": "\"Hehe, while you're taking a break, Commander, care to play a game with me?\"",
    "“圣诞老人只会给好孩子礼物。”——按照这样的说法，我本不应该得到礼物才对，但眼前的这份礼物又是什么？是圣诞老人搞错了吗……阁下，您为什么在偷笑？能解释下吗？": "\"Santa Claus only gives gifts to good children.\"—According to that saying, I shouldn't be receiving a gift at all. So what is this gift before me? Did Santa Claus make a mistake...? Your Excellency, why are you chuckling? Care to explain?",
    "“好、好的！请把警备的任务交给我吧！”": "\"A-Alright! Please leave the security assignment to me!\"",
    "“妈妈”……呵。": "\"Mother\"... Heh.",
    "“就算是我，也一定能做得到……”": "\"Even someone like me can definitely do it...\"",
    "“工作辛苦了~稍等一下，为您冲泡的咖啡马上就好。”获取后，可在中央卧室内布置该家具。": "\"Thank you for your hard work~ Just a moment, your freshly brewed coffee will be ready shortly.\" After obtaining, this furniture can be placed in the Central Bedroom.",
    "“您的订单已送达。”": "\"Your order has been delivered.\"",
    "“我、我想再多帮到指挥官一些……”": "\"I-I want to be of even more help to the Commander...\"",
    "“我不会试图摘月，我要月亮奔我而来”……哎呀，这是哪部电影里的台词来着？在想出答案之前，今晚的绝佳赏月位就由我和指挥官共享啦~": "\"I won't try to pluck the moon; I want the moon to come to me\"... Oh my, which movie was that quote from again? Well, before we figure it out, the Commander and I get to share tonight's best moon-viewing spot~",
    "“我们无处不在——莫科什将与指挥官同行至世界尽头。”": "\"We are everywhere—Mokosh will accompany the Commander to the ends of the earth.\"",
    "“我希望，你们是发自内心地追随我，而不只是出于‘任务’或‘命令’。不论我发布了怎样的命令，你们都应该基于自己的判断、对我的认同，以及对未来目标的理解而行动。”": "\"I hope you follow me from the bottom of your hearts, not merely out of 'duty' or 'orders.' Regardless of what orders I issue, you should act based on your own judgment, your trust in me, and your understanding of our future goals.\"",
    "“指·挥·官～你的专属医疗人形来照顾你了！”\n\n当寇尔芙走进房间的时候，我立刻被她的装束吸引了。那是她当初在医疗队穿过的服装。\n“哎呀？指挥官不会是病傻了吧，直勾勾地看着人家，这身衣服是指挥官你送给人家的哦。”\n\n在连续几天的熬夜工作后，我的状态太不好。昨天，在寇尔芙的叮嘱下，我选择了卧床休息。我想不起自己是如何睡着的，只知道寇尔芙一直在身边照顾着我。\n天刚刚亮，随着寇尔芙拉开窗帘，朦胧的阳光洒到了房间内。我也能看清她的装束了。\n\n“嗯嗯，指挥官的脸色好多了，果然是睡眠不足导致的呢，你感觉怎么样呢？”\n轻柔的上衣裙摆像是白花，我自然地想起和寇尔芙一起在净化区里看到过的那朵。她的头发则被编成了麻花辫，比平时多了几分温柔。\n\n“我觉得挺好的。”\n“指挥官是说……你的身体，还是人家的装扮啊？”面对我的视线，寇尔芙很开心，但也似乎有点紧张，不断地整理发辫。\n“都挺好，只不过……你不会想起那些难受的事吗？”\n\n说起这件衣服的来历，它毕竟是经历了那场惨剧的服装。\n\n“没事哦，由于指挥官的缘故，这件服装上已经积攒了好多～快乐的回忆了！”\n“我们经历了那么多事情，也约定了以后前进的道路，所以，过去的痛苦无法再对人家造成伤害了～”\n\n寇尔芙坐到床边，拉住我的手。我吓了一跳，但发现她是要替我测血压。\n\n“所以接下来……就让我也来替指挥官承担你过去的痛苦吧。”\n寇尔芙的手温柔地拂过，开始了检查。此时，阳光彻底进入房间内，将她那身红白相间的护士服映照得更加清晰。\n\n她又对我笑了一下，在光芒的照射中，笑容里已经看不到一点阴霾了。": "\"Com—man—der~ Your personal medical Doll has come to take care of you!\"\n\nThe moment Colphne stepped into the room, I was immediately drawn to her attire. It was the uniform she used to wear back when she was in the medical corps.\n\"Oh? Don't tell me you've gone silly from your fever, Commander, staring at me like that? You're the one who gave me this outfit, you know.\"\n\nAfter working late several nights in a row, I had been in terrible shape. Yesterday, under Colphne's strict urging, I finally gave in and went to bed to rest. I couldn't recall how I fell asleep—all I knew was that Colphne had stayed by my side, looking after me the entire time.\nDawn had just broken. As Colphne drew back the curtains, soft, hazy sunlight filtered into the room, allowing me to see her outfit clearly.\n\n\"Mm-hmm, your complexion looks much better, Commander. It really was just lack of sleep. How are you feeling?\"\nThe gentle hem of her top fluttered like white petals, naturally reminding me of that flower Colphne and I had seen together in the Purification Zone. Her hair was tied into braids, lending her an even gentler air than usual.\n\n\"I feel pretty good.\"\n\"Do you mean... your body, Commander, or my outfit?\" Meeting my gaze, Colphne beamed with joy, yet seemed slightly self-conscious as she kept adjusting her braids.\n\"Both. It's just... doesn't it bring back painful memories for you?\"\n\nSpeaking of this outfit's origins, it was, after all, the uniform that had witnessed that tragedy.\n\n\"It's alright! Thanks to you, Commander, this uniform is already filled with so many~ happy memories!\"\n\"We've been through so much together, and we've promised each other the path we'll walk ahead. So the pain of the past can't hurt me anymore~\"\n\nColphne sat down on the edge of the bed and took my hand. Startled for a moment, I quickly realized she was just checking my blood pressure.\n\n\"So from now on... let me bear the pain of your past for you too, Commander.\"\nWith a tender touch, Colphne began her examination. By now, sunlight fully flooded the room, illuminating her red-and-white nurse uniform with even greater clarity.\n\nShe smiled at me once more, and in the bright morning light, not a single trace of shadow remained in her smile.",
    "“指——挥——官，今天是你的生日，接下来的时间请都交给我吧！”这是模仿夏克里送给指挥官的祝福哦，很像吧？嘻嘻~虽然台词是别人的，但想为指挥官庆祝生日的心，可是百分之百属于我自己的哟！": "\"Com—man—der, today is your birthday, so please leave all your time to me from here on out!\" That was an impression of Sharkry's birthday wish to you, wasn't it spot-on? Teehee~ Even if those were someone else's lines, my desire to celebrate your birthday is one hundred percent my own!",
    "“指、指挥官，我可以邀请您坐下……陪我聊聊天吗？”": "\"C-Commander, may I invite you to sit down... and chat with me for a bit?\"",
    "“指挥官~这个姿势可爱吗？做一个同款玩偶怎么样？”": "\"Commander~ Is this pose cute? How about making a matching plushie of it?\"",
    "“指挥官……我回来了。这一次，我将永远留在你身边。”\n昔日伙伴，今日回归，参与可得<color=#df9e00ff>「重逢许可(限时)」</color>×80，必得自选人形！": "\"Commander... I'm back. This time, I will stay by your side forever.\"\nOld comrades return today! Participate to receive <color=#df9e00ff>[Reunion Permit (Limited-Time)]</color> ×80, guaranteeing a Doll of your choice!",
    "“指挥官……谢谢您愿意坐在我的身边。”": "\"Commander... thank you for being willing to sit beside me.\"",
    "“指挥官听过贝壳里的声音吗？据说那是大海的呼吸声……您靠得再近一点，就能听得更清楚哦。”\n春田的衣装·睡醒的人鱼的可换装部件，获取后，可用于同类别部件换装。": "\"Has the Commander ever listened to the sound inside a seashell? They say it's the breath of the sea... If you lean in a little closer, you'll be able to hear it even more clearly.\"\nInterchangeable part for Springfield's outfit [The Waking Mermaid]. Once acquired, can be used to customize parts in the same category.",
    "“指挥官，像这样站在您的面前，我……稍微有些紧张。”": "\"Commander, standing before you like this, I'm... a little nervous.\"",
    "“指挥官，您累了吗？好好休息一下吧，比方说……坐下来一起看星星……”获取后，可在中央卧室内布置该家具。": "\"Commander, are you tired? Please take a good rest, for example... sit down and watch the stars together...\" After obtaining, this furniture can be placed in the Central Bedroom.",
    "“指挥官，请牵住我的手，和我一起聆听海风的呼唤吧~”\n春田微笑着压了压帽檐，邀你与她共享这段温暖的海岛时光。": "\"Commander, please take my hand and listen to the call of the ocean breeze with me~\"\nSpringfield smiles and tips her hat, inviting you to share this warm island moment with her.",
    "“某种存在”……是指希岸的力量吗？还是说是……M4？": "\"A certain existence\"... Does that refer to the power of Nirvana? Or could it be... M4?",
    "“梆啪咔梆~锡兵军团登场！”": "\"Ta-da-da-da~ The Tin Soldier Legion has arrived!\"",
    "“欢迎光临我的玩具商店~今天的特价商品，刚好是……别紧张，我已经替你拆好了。”\n刘易斯蹦蹦跳跳地来到你面前，她的眼睛亮晶晶的，像是刚发现一件有趣的商品。": "\"Welcome to my toy shop~ Today's featured sale item happens to be... Don't worry, I already unboxed it for you.\"\nLewis skips over in front of you, her eyes sparkling brightly as if she has just discovered a fascinating new toy."
}
